OL,4,CUN court delivering judgment over      
OL,5,Cwhether Myanmar committed genocide     
OL,6,Cagainst Rohingya                       
OL,7,GThe International Court of Justice     
OL,8,G(ICJ) is delivering what is expected   
OL,9,Gto be a landmark judgment on Myanmar,  
OL,10,Gwhich is accused of committing         
OL,11,Ggenocide against its Rohingya minority.
OL,13,FDelivering the judgement, Judge Yuji   
OL,14,FIwasawa says there is a "reasonable    
OL,15,Finference that Myanmar security forces 
OL,16,Facted with genocidal intent", and      
OL,17,FMyanmar had the "intention to destroy" 
OL,18,Fa substantial part of the Rohingya.    
